      "statement": "The default multitask_strategy='interrupt' halts an active run (progress preserved by the sync checkpoint) and resumes the agent with full history plus the new message, while background follow-ups like /baby-sit can opt into enqueue; because the platform handles in-flight follow-ups, webhook triggers no longer need a busy-check or in-process lock.",
